@{
    Layout = null;
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] - Legacy Vault</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body class="public-page about-page">
    <header class="landing-header">
        <div class="landing-shell nav-wrap">
            <a class="brand-mark-link" href="@Url.Action("Index", "Home")" aria-label="Legacy Vault home">
                <img src="~/images/legacy-shield.svg" alt="Legacy Vault logo" class="brand-badge" />
                <span class="brand-wordmark">Legacy Vault</span>
            </a>

            <nav class="top-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
                <a href="@Url.Action("Index", "Home")">Home</a>
                <a href="@Url.Action("About", "Home")" class="active">About Us</a>
                <a href="@Url.Action("Contact", "Home")">Contact</a>
            </nav>

            <div class="nav-actions">
                <a class="nav-login" href="/Identity/Account/Login">Login</a>
                <a class="nav-register" href="/Identity/Account/Register">Register</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="public-main">
        <section class="about-split">
            <div class="landing-shell about-split-inner">
                <div class="about-hero-copy">
                    <span class="section-kicker">WHAT IS LEGACY VAULT?</span>
                    <h1>Your Digital Legacy, Safely Organized</h1>
                    <p>
                        Legacy Vault gives you one secure place to organise important digital assets,
                        documents, trusted beneficiaries and instructions for the future. You decide what
                        information is stored and who can access it when it matters most.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="info-grid-section">
            <div class="landing-shell info-grid-shell">
                <div class="info-card">
                    <h2>The Problem</h2>
                    <p>When an individual passes away, their family may be left managing a complex digital environment they cannot easily access.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Unknown passwords for banking, email and social media accounts</li>
                        <li>Important documents such as wills and insurance policies may be inaccessible</li>
                        <li>Recurring subscriptions may continue charging the estate</li>
                        <li>Social media accounts may remain active without clear instructions</li>
                        <li>Important information may be stored in unknown locations</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Without a centralised solution, families can experience unnecessary stress and difficulty managing these digital assets.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="info-card accent-card">
                    <h2>The Solution</h2>
                    <p>Legacy Vault provides a secure digital estate management platform that puts important information in one place.</p>
                    <p>With Legacy Vault, users can:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Store digital account information</li>
                        <li>Upload essential documents</li>
                        <li>Assign a trusted Digital Executor</li>
                        <li>Create instructions for their digital assets</li>
                        <li>Control who can access their information</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>This helps ensure that digital assets are managed according to the user's wishes while reducing the burden on family members.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="how-it-works">
            <div class="landing-shell">
                <span class="section-kicker centered">HOW IT WORKS</span>
                <h2>Four Steps. No Single Point of Failure.</h2>
                <p class="how-copy">Your estate is locked and watched. It opens only after every condition you set has been verified. No shortcuts. No overrides.</p>

                <div class="steps-grid">
                    <div class="step">
                        <div class="step-badge">01</div>
                        <h3>You Encrypt Your Instructions</h3>
                        <p>Your will, asset list, and distribution directives are encrypted on your device before they ever leave it. We never see the contents.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step">
                        <div class="step-badge">02</div>
                        <h3>Guardians Hold the Keys</h3>
                        <p>Your chosen guardians each receive a cryptographic key share. No single guardian, not even us, can open the vault alone.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step">
                        <div class="step-badge">03</div>
                        <h3>The System Watches</h3>
                        <p>Continuous integrity checks confirm your vault remains untouched and your notification chains are active. Any anomaly triggers an alert.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step">
                        <div class="step-badge">04</div>
                        <h3>Consent Unlocks Everything</h3>
                        <p>When the conditions you set are met, being verified absence, guardian consent, and family dialogue, the vault opens exactly as you intended.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="benefit-band">
            <div class="landing-shell">
                <h2>Built Around Security, Trust and Peace of Mind</h2>
                <p>Keep sensitive legacy information organised and protected while deciding who can access it and when.</p>

                <div class="benefits-grid">
                    <div class="benefit-item">
                        <div class="benefit-icon">🔒</div>
                        <h3>Secure</h3>
                        <p>Keep sensitive legacy information organised and protected.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="benefit-item">
                        <div class="benefit-icon">👤</div>
                        <h3>Trusted Access</h3>
                        <p>Decide who can access your information.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="benefit-item">
                        <div class="benefit-icon">📁</div>
                        <h3>Everything in One Place</h3>
                        <p>Manage documents and digital assets from one central vault.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="benefit-item">
                        <div class="benefit-icon">❤</div>
                        <h3>Peace of Mind</h3>
                        <p>Give your loved ones clearer guidance for the future.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
